(text "Protection target: any pin pair +/-30 V continuous (miswiring), surge +/-1 kV, ESD +/-8 kV contact." (at 30.48 172.212 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c9849e73-29ca-5ed7-b496-3ce0d012fd8c))
(text "Power symbols: GND, +3V3, +3V3A (analog 3.3 V), +5V, VIN_P (protected input), CHASSIS.  Inter-sheet signals: global labels." (at 30.48 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f81220da-233e-59a6-9404-ce8244e9c80d))
(text "History v0.3-v0.8 (MCU G0B1, JST harness, DAC8760/TPS26611 datasheet pinouts, RTN isolation, gated DAC SCLK ...): docs/decision-log.md #9-#26." (at 30.48 183.388 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee99cd3a-917c-5817-ae28-79f99d02824c))
(text "v0.9: 3-pass review (docs/hw/final-review-260313A.md): OVP 32.6 V (R5 36.5k) + TPS26611 +Vs follower clamp ~26.4 V; D2 -> TVS3301; eFuse IN C2; buck CIN;" (at 30.48 188.976 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 16811ae8-69b7-50e3-8bc5-1be1543d9739))
(text "      RS485_DE 10k pull-down (in-house bootloader, dec. #31); THVD2410; X7R only; R2 HV 1206; SGOOD -> PA0/PA4; CS_CDC -> PA15; VIN_SENSE PB0;" (at 30.48 194.564 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c78f7876-1536-595c-9cac-5cf81555b7e3))
(text "      LATCH/CS pull-ups; OPA197 V+ = DAC AVDD; R31/R41 100k; SWD no-connect flags removed; sheet Aux: +Vs clamp, VIN monitor (DAC boost / HSE / sensor ESD: no room, dec. #32)." (at 30.48 200.152 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 879b047e-df8f-51f9-8d65-4809faed8586))
(text "Footprints: KiCad 7.0.11 library + project library HMT500_260313A (LMR36006 RNX0012A, GDT Bourns 2035-xx-SM, TVS3301 pad floating)." (at 30.48 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 472f16e4-96a8-57a4-926e-fbf88ea57617))
(text "표기 규칙: 부품번호 = 굵은 글자 (R1, U4) / 부품값 = 보통 글자 (10k, DAC8760) / 전원 네트 = 기울인 글자 (+3V3, VIN_P)" (at 30.48 211.328 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8794cc83-d2dc-551b-a28c-527759e549f9))
(text "         신호 네트 = 테두리 있는 라벨 (SPI_SCK, OUT1_EXT) - 네트 이름은 부품번호·부품명과 겹치지 않게 지음" (at 30.48 216.916 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2daf6dfc-f2d2-5db4-bfb5-4f933c9cf81b))
(text "         라벨 모양 = 신호 방향: 뾰족한 쪽이 밖 = 이 시트에서 내보냄(출력), 안 = 받음(입력), 양쪽 = 양방향, 네모 = 아날로그·수동" (at 30.48 222.504 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 36493700-5f7f-50af-9073-c1528b0d7336))
(text "글자 겹침: 생성기가 부품 몸체·핀·선·라벨·메모와 겹치지 않는 자리에 자동 배치하고, 겹치면 생성 실패로 처리" (at 30.48 228.092 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc9d3a9b-504e-51d0-8f1e-b801728257ef))
